{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "35c90792-2995-8e6f-89e1-8a770a36a1dd",
  "created_at": "2026-01-25T13:27:41-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Jorge Moniz",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T13:22:46-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. How can I help you this afternoon?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T13:22:52-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello. Yes. My name is Jorge Moniz. I am calling about water on my street. Storm drain, I think, is blocked."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T13:23:01-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, Mr. Moniz, let me grab that down. What street are you on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T13:23:07-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Dean Avenue. One sixty-six Dean Avenue. Fifth Ward."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T13:23:11-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "One sixty-six Dean. Got it. And what's it doing, is it flooding right now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T13:23:17-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, right now. The snow turned to rain this morning and everything is melting at once. Water is collecting at the low end of Dean Avenue. It is big puddle, like small pond. And this is not first time. Always same place, always nobody fixes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T13:23:36-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, with the snow melting and rain on top of it, drains get buried pretty fast. Is the water up on your property at all, or just in the street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T13:23:49-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is in my driveway also. The apron, the part at the bottom, holds the water. Then it goes down toward garage door. I put towels. [pause] I am renter, so I cannot do much more."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T13:24:04-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so driveway apron, water running toward the garage door. Writing that down. Has it gotten inside the garage yet?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T13:24:13-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not yet. Close. Maybe two, three meters from door now. Every hour it is closer."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T13:24:20-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. And the drain itself, can you see the grate? Is it covered with snow or leaves, or is it just full of water?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T13:24:30-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I see the grate a little. There is ice and slush on top. [crosstalk] Sorry, you say?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T13:24:38-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, go ahead, I was just saying slush and ice on top, that'd do it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T13:24:45-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Slush, ice, some trash. Water cannot go down. And I want to ask, this is city drain or state one? Somebody told me maybe state, because road is big."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T13:24:58-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good question. Dean Avenue itself is a city street, so I'd expect the drains on it to be ours. But I'll note it and have the crew confirm when they look at it. If it turns out to be state, we'd pass it along to them."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T13:25:17-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Because I call before, and one person says city, other person says maybe not. I am tired of this. Nobody comes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T13:25:27-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. I'm not seeing anything from you in front of me right now, but I'll put this in with today's date so it's on record."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T13:25:39-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Please. And there is another thing. I worry about kids. There is school drop-off lane near here, and every morning it is mess. Cars, parents, children walking. With this water, somebody will step in or slip."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T13:25:54-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's a good point to flag. A big puddle where kids are walking, that gets taken more seriously."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T13:26:02-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Also dog walkers. Many people walk dogs there. They go around the water, they go into the road. Cars come fast. Very dangerous, especially when it freezes tonight."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T13:26:14-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, rain today and then it drops below freezing, that could turn into a sheet of ice. I'll mark it as a safety concern. Okay, so I have: one sixty-six Dean Avenue, low end of the street, drain blocked with ice and slush, water into the driveway toward the garage. Anything else on that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T13:26:36-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that is all. When someone comes?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T13:26:40-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Crews are stretched across the city today with this storm, so I'd say it's likely tomorrow at the earliest, depending on what else comes in. If it gets worse, say it's actually coming into the garage, call back and we'll bump it up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T13:26:58-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Tomorrow. I hope so. I do not want to call fourth time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T13:27:04-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fair enough. Do you want a callback number on the ticket, in case the crew needs to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T13:27:12-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Four zero one, five five five, zero one five seven."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T13:27:17-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-five-seven. Got it. And it's Moniz, M-O-N-I-Z?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T13:27:22-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, correct. Jorge, with J."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T13:27:25-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. It's in the system, Mr. Moniz. Stay out of that water if you can, and keep an eye on the garage."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T13:27:35-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Thank you. Goodbye."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T13:27:38-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Take care."
    }
  ],
